/	007	JM	09-APR-81	Deleted patch into H2PAT since this
/					location is no longer used
/	006	DAO	18-SEP-80	MERGED WITH X3.5
/	005	DM,JM	15-SEPT-80	MERGED SCANDI AND EUROPE/ENGLISH
/	004	DSS	09-JUL-80	MOFIDIED FOR ENGLISH/FRENCH-CANADIAN
/	003	CMW	5-MAY-80	ENTERED CANADA TRANSLATIONS
